{
  "app": "karak2",
  "onboarded": true,
  "auto": true,
  "node": "24.21.0",
  "repo": "/home/openclaw/Dev/karak2",
  "branch": "main",
  "releaseRoot": "/opt/developed-apps/karak2/releases",
  "runtimeUser": "developed-karak2",
  "archivePaths": [
    "backend",
    "frontend",
    "gateway",
    "packages",
    "deploy",
    "package.json",
    "pnpm-lock.yaml",
    "pnpm-workspace.yaml",
    "turbo.json",
    "tsconfig.base.json"
  ],
  "migrationPaths": [
    "backend/db"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "One service (deploy/run.mjs starts Nest backend, Next frontend and the identity gateway); a release switch restarts it, which signs everyone out locally and drops in-memory games.",
    "backend/db SQL has no ledger: any change there blocks until applied by hand (deploy/README.md order), then --migrations-applied.",
    "Slim release: full install, test, build, then a clean 'pnpm install --prod --offline' (reinstalling on top keeps dev tools; 'pnpm prune --prod' breaks workspace links), minus build-only @next/swc binaries and browser-only pixi.js (bundled into .next; a guard fails the build if the server ever requires it). Verified: Next renders every page without either.",
    "Health: the backend /health does a database round trip; publicly /health and /api/health are SUPERADMIN-only, so deploy checks use the private sockets."
  ],
  "sides": {
    "app": {
      "paths": [
        "backend",
        "frontend",
        "gateway",
        "packages",
        "deploy/run.mjs",
        "package.json",
        "pnpm-lock.yaml",
        "pnpm-workspace.yaml"
      ],
      "env": {
        "CI": "true",
        "NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED": "1"
      },
      "steps": [
        "pnpm install --frozen-lockfile",
        "pnpm test",
        "pnpm build",
        "rm -rf frontend/.next/cache",
        "rm -rf node_modules backend/node_modules frontend/node_modules gateway/node_modules packages/*/node_modules",
        "pnpm install --prod --frozen-lockfile --offline",
        "find node_modules/.pnpm -maxdepth 1 -name '@next+swc-*' -exec rm -rf {} +",
        "if grep -rqE 'require\\(\"pixi\\.js' frontend/.next/server; then echo 'pixi.js is required server-side; keep it' >&2; exit 1; fi",
        "find node_modules/.pnpm -maxdepth 1 -name 'pixi.js@*' -exec rm -rf {} + && rm -f frontend/node_modules/pixi.js"
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "from": "backend",
          "to": "backend"
        },
        {
          "from": "frontend",
          "to": "frontend"
        },
        {
          "from": "gateway",
          "to": "gateway"
        },
        {
          "from": "packages",
          "to": "packages"
        },
        {
          "from": "deploy",
          "to": "deploy"
        },
        {
          "from": "node_modules",
          "to": "node_modules"
        },
        {
          "from": "package.json",
          "to": "package.json"
        },
        {
          "from": "pnpm-lock.yaml",
          "to": "pnpm-lock.yaml"
        },
        {
          "from": "pnpm-workspace.yaml",
          "to": "pnpm-workspace.yaml"
        }
      ],
      "verify": [
        "deploy/run.mjs",
        "backend/dist/main.js",
        "frontend/.next/BUILD_ID",
        "frontend/server.mjs",
        "gateway/server.mjs",
        "frontend/node_modules/next",
        "gateway/node_modules/@developed/ecosystem-auth"
      ],
      "switch": {
        "type": "symlink-restart",
        "link": "/opt/developed-apps/karak2/current",
        "unit": "developed-karak2.service"
      },
      "health": [
        {
          "socket": "/run/karak2/api.sock",
          "url": "http://localhost/health",
          "status": 200
        },
        {
          "socket": "/run/karak2/web.sock",
          "url": "http://localhost/",
          "status": 200
        },
        {
          "url": "https://karak2.developed.sk/health",
          "status": 401
        },
        {
          "url": "https://karak2.developed.sk/api/heroes",
          "status": 401
        },
        {
          "url": "https://karak2.developed.sk/",
          "status": 303
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
